1. Project Overview

The Autism Assistive AI Mirror is an AI-powered assistive application designed to support individuals who may benefit from visual and structured assistance during daily activities.

The system uses a webcam and Python to create a "smart mirror" interface that can:

Detect whether a face is visible
Provide visual communication prompts
Display daily routines
Give calming/breathing reminders
Show simple emotion-related prompts without making diagnostic claims
Provide positive reinforcement
Display personalized messages
